{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1106","id":3968337054,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87siASe","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1106","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1106.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1106.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1106","number":1106,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Bilingual UX P1 copy QA","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR implements the Bilingual UX P1 consistency pass for the CIE-Copilot frontend.\n\nIt keeps the V1 China-facing baseline as `中文 UI + English 学科 / Cambridge exam terms`, while cleaning lower-priority UI chrome, filters, metadata, tabs, cards, task labels, and detail panels. The pass preserves exam-native and academic terms such as `Paper`, `Topic`, `Mark scheme`, paper/question codes, method names, formulas, and official content.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Consolidated bilingual UI terms and display helpers for page chrome, task states, evidence states, card metadata, and relative update labels.\n- Polished visible UI copy across Dashboard, Subject Hub, Paper Workspace, Topic Detail, Study Session, Review Queue, Review Task Detail, Error Book, Learning Cards, Import Question, Search, and Academic Profile.\n- Updated Review Queue status/action wording so status badges use state labels such as `待处理`, `部分完成`, `已完成`, and `已过期` rather than action verbs.\n- Kept conservative diagnostic language, including `仅供诊断 · 非官方评分`, where scoring or marking could be misunderstood.\n- Added `--language-mode` support to the screenshot runner so bilingual screenshot QA can be reproduced explicitly.\n- Added P1 screenshot artifacts and a rerun all-page screenshot artifact under `artifacts/bilingual-copy-p1/` and `artifacts/bilingual-all-pages-2026-07-01-p1-rerun/`.\n\n## Intentionally Preserved English\n\nThe PR does not translate exam-native or controlled academic content. In particular, it preserves Cambridge and syllabus-facing terms such as `Paper`, `Topic`, `Mark scheme`, paper/question identifiers, official subject names, method names such as `Integration by Parts`, and raw question/mark scheme text.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run test -- --run src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__ src/components/__tests__/cjkText.test.jsx`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint src/pages/paper-workspace/content/i18n.js src/pages/paper-workspace/content/page-formatters.js src/pages/paper-workspace/content/review.js src/pages/paper-workspace/content/artifacts.js src/pages/paper-workspace/components/*.jsx src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/*.jsx src/components/CjkText.jsx src/components/__tests__/cjkText.test.jsx scripts/dev/cie-shot.mjs`\n- `npm run build`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nThe full repo lint still has pre-existing legacy lint debt outside this PR scope; the changed-file ESLint run completed with no errors and only existing fast-refresh warnings.\n\n## Screenshot QA\n\nAll mounted student-facing routes were captured in `zh-CN-bilingual` mode at 1366px and 1440px:\n\n- `artifacts/bilingual-all-pages-2026-07-01-p1-rerun/screenshots/1366/`\n- `artifacts/bilingual-all-pages-2026-07-01-p1-rerun/screenshots/1440/`\n- `artifacts/bilingual-all-pages-2026-07-01-p1-rerun/visual-qa-report.md`\n\nThis produced 28 PNGs across 14 routes. Spot checks covered Review Queue, Study Session, Learning Cards, and Dashboard.","created_at":"2026-07-01T05:49:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T06:04:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T06:04:41Z","merged_at":"2026-07-01T06:04:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"8efa11dddbbb694ccf157f74f00056508797ab93","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1106/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1106/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1106/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/216d0b97a1e91f8c72f260594230074b61b0c42e","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/bilingual-ux-p1-copy-qa","ref":"codex/bilingual-ux-p1-copy-qa","sha":"216d0b97a1e91f8c72f260594230074b61b0c42e","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscript